+static PEXCEPTION_ROUTINE
+RtlpUnwindFull (
+    IN ULONG ImageBase,
=1 1422 3
+    OUT PVOID *HandlerData,
+    OUT PBOOLEAN Frame,
=1 1427 7
+    This function unwinds a function by the unwind codes of its .xdata
+    record: its header, the epilogue scopes, the unwind codes, and the image
+    relative address of the exception handler and the handler data.
